      "shield": true,
      "title": "How do you ace a school interview?",
      "body": "Let's build answers that work."
    },
    {
      "layout": "content",
      "id": "importance",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#1a1a2e",
      "title": "Why is this lesson important?",
      "body": "<ul><li>Interviews decide who gets into international schools.</li><li>Strong answers win scholarships and IB places.</li><li>This structure works in every interview.</li></ul>"
    },
    {
      "layout": "content",
      "id": "recall",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#1a1a2e",
      "title": "What happens in a school interview?",
      "body": "<p style=\"font-size:36px;line-height:1.6\">Talk to your partner. What does the interviewer want?</p><p style=\"color:#ffdd00;text-align:center;font-size:38px;font-weight:700;margin-top:22px\">Opinion &mdash; Reason &mdash; Example</p>"
    },
    {
      "layout": "content",
      "id": "strategy-prep",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#1a1a2e",
      "title": "Strategy: The PREP Formula",
      "body": "<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #555;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;font-size:36px\">P &mdash; Position</td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #555;font-size:36px\">Say your opinion first. In my opinion&hellip;</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #555;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;font-size:36px\">R &mdash; Reason</td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #555;font-size:36px\">Give one reason. One reason is&hellip;</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #555;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;font-size:36px\">E &mdash; Example</td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #555;font-size:36px\">Add an example. For example&hellip;</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;font-size:36px\">P &mdash; Position</td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:36px\">Repeat your opinion. That&rsquo;s why&hellip;</td></tr></table><p style=\"color:#ffdd00;text-align:center;font-size:34px;font-weight:700;margin-top:18px\">No 'because' in the first sentence.</p><p style=\"text-align:center;font-size:32px;margin-top:14px;color:#fff\">Your worksheet shows the same formula.</p>"
    },
    {
      "layout": "auto-animate-pair",
      "id": "demo-prep",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#116466",
      "title": "Try it: A weak answer",
      "body": "<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:36px\">Should school start later in the morning?</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;width:36px;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:36px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:24px;text-align:center\">&nbsp;</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:36px\">Yes, I think that's good. I'm tired in the morning. It would help me.</td></tr></table>"
    },
    {
      "layout": "auto-animate-pair",
      "id": "demo-prep",
      "step": 2,
      "background_color": "#116466",
      "title": "Try it: The PREP answer",
      "body": "<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:36px\">Should school start later in the morning?</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;width:36px;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:36px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:24px;text-align:center\">&nbsp;</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:36px\"><strong style=\"color:#ffdd00\">In my opinion</strong>, school should start later. <strong style=\"color:#ffdd00\">One reason is</strong> that students need more sleep. <strong style=\"color:#ffdd00\">For example</strong>, teenagers need about nine hours of sleep. <strong style=\"color:#ffdd00\">That's why</strong> a later start would help us learn.</td></tr></table>"
    },
    {
      "layout": "content",
      "id": "strategy-why",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#1a1a2e",
      "title": "Strategy: Why questions",
      "body": "<p style=\"font-size:36px;line-height:1.7\">Answer with your reason first.</p><p style=\"font-size:36px;line-height:1.7\">Don't repeat the question.</p><p style=\"font-size:36px;line-height:1.7\">Because the school teaches in English.</p>"
    },
    {
      "layout": "auto-animate-pair",
      "id": "demo-why",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#116466",
      "title": "Try it: Why questions",
      "body": "<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:36px\">Why do you want to study at MUIDS?</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"padding:8px 0;color:#ffdd00;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:36px\">Which answer is better?</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;width:36px;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;border-bottom:1px solid #444\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:24px;text-align:center\">&nbsp;</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:36px\">I want to study at MUIDS. I really do.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;width:36px;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;border-bottom:1px solid #444\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:24px;text-align:center\">&nbsp;</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:36px\">Because of the way they teach. Students learn by doing things.</td></tr></table>"
    },
    {
      "layout": "auto-animate-pair",
      "id": "demo-why",
      "step": 2,
      "background_color": "#116466",
      "title": "Try it: Why questions",
      "body": "<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:36px\">Why do you want to study at MUIDS?</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"padding:8px 0;color:#ffdd00;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:36px\">Which answer is better?</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;width:36px;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;border-bottom:1px solid #444\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:24px;text-align:center\">&nbsp;</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:36px\">I want to study at MUIDS. I really do.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;width:36px;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;border-bottom:1px solid #444\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:24px;text-align:center;color:#2ecc71;font-weight:900\">&#10003;</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:36px\">Because of the way they teach. Students learn by doing things.</td></tr></table>"
    },
    {
      "layout": "content",
      "id": "strategy-challenge",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#1a1a2e",
      "title": "Strategy: Challenge questions",
      "body": "<p style=\"font-size:36px;line-height:1.7\">Tell a short story.</p><p style=\"font-size:36px;line-height:1.7\">Situation. Action. Result.</p>"
    },
    {
      "layout": "auto-animate-pair",
      "id": "demo-challenge",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#116466",
      "title": "Try it: Challenge questions",
      "body": "<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:36px\">What do you do when you face a challenge?</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"padding:8px 0;color:#ffdd00;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:36px\">Which answer is best?</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;width:36px;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;border-bottom:1px solid #444\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:24px;text-align:center\">&nbsp;</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:36px\">Last year, I had a difficult exam. I made a plan and practised every day. I passed.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;width:36px;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;border-bottom:1px solid #444\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:24px;text-align:center\">&nbsp;</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:36px\">I try to stay calm and do my best.</td></tr></table>"
    },
    {
      "layout": "auto-animate-pair",
      "id": "demo-challenge",
      "step": 2,
      "background_color": "#116466",
      "title": "Try it: Challenge questions",
      "body": "<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:36px\">What do you do when you face a challenge?</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"padding:8px 0;color:#ffdd00;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:36px\">Which answer is best?</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;width:36px;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;border-bottom:1px solid #444\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:24px;text-align:center;color:#2ecc71;font-weight:900\">&#10003;</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:36px\">Last year, I had a difficult exam. I made a plan and practised every day. I passed.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;width:36px;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;border-bottom:1px solid #444\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:24px;text-align:center\">&nbsp;</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:36px\">I try to stay calm and do my best.</td></tr></table>"
    },
