    {
      "layout": "content",
      "id": "answer-model",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#052e0d",
      "title": "Answers: Why MUIDS?",
      "body": "<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;font-size:36px\">Answer first</td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:36px\">Because of the way they teach.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;font-size:36px\">Reason</td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:36px\">Students learn by doing things, not just reading.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;font-size:36px\">Example</td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:36px\">Science students do real experiments and present them in English.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;font-size:36px\">Close</td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:36px\">So MUIDS is exactly the school I want.</td></tr></table>"
    },
    {
      "layout": "content",
      "id": "transition-task",
      "step": 1,
