    {
      "layout": "content",
      "id": "controlled",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#1a1a2e",
      "title": "Worksheet: Parts A &amp; B",
      "body": "<p style=\"font-size:36px;line-height:1.6\"><strong>Part A:</strong> Put the answer in order (1&ndash;4).</p><p style=\"font-size:36px;line-height:1.6\">Question: Should mobile phones be banned at school?</p><p style=\"font-size:36px;line-height:1.6\"><strong>Part B:</strong> Complete the frames. Use each phrase once.</p>"
    },
    {
      "layout": "content",
      "id": "transition-cutup",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#c0392b",
      "title": "Sentence Cut-Up"
    },
    {
      "layout": "content",
      "id": "cutup-instru",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#1a1a2e",
      "title": "Your strips",
      "body": "<p style=\"font-size:36px;line-height:1.6\">Your strips make one interview.</p><p style=\"font-size:36px;line-height:1.6\">Put them in the correct order.</p><p style=\"font-size:36px;line-height:1.6\">Then practise it with your partner.</p>"
    },
    {
      "layout": "content",
      "id": "answer-cutup-b1-1",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#052e0d",
      "title": "Answers: Sentence Cut-Up (B1) &mdash; 1/2",
      "body": "<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td style=\"padding:4px 10px 4px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:32px;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;width:44px\">1.</td><td style=\"padding:4px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:32px\">Good morning. What do you enjoy doing in your free time?</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:4px 10px 4px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:32px;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;width:44px\">2.</td><td style=\"padding:4px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:32px\">I really like playing the guitar.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:4px 10px 4px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:32px;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;width:44px\">3.</td><td style=\"padding:4px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:32px\">It helps me relax after a long day at school.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:4px 10px 4px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:32px;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;width:44px\">4.</td><td style=\"padding:4px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:32px\">For example, I practise for thirty minutes every evening.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:4px 10px 4px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:32px;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;width:44px\">5.</td><td style=\"padding:4px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:32px\">So music is my favourite way to unwind.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:4px 10px 4px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:32px;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;width:44px\">6.</td><td style=\"padding:4px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:32px\">That's nice. Do you play in a band?</td></tr></table>"
    },
    {
      "layout": "content",
      "id": "answer-cutup-b1-2",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#052e0d",
      "title": "Answers: Sentence Cut-Up (B1) &mdash; 2/2",
      "body": "<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td style=\"padding:4px 10px 4px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:32px;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;width:44px\">1.</td><td style=\"padding:4px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:32px\">Not yet, but I'd love to.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:4px 10px 4px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:32px;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;width:44px\">2.</td><td style=\"padding:4px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:32px\">I think playing with other people is the best way to improve.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:4px 10px 4px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:32px;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;width:44px\">3.</td><td style=\"padding:4px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:32px\">For example, my cousin plays with his friends every weekend.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:4px 10px 4px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:32px;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;width:44px\">4.</td><td style=\"padding:4px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:32px\">Lovely. Thank you for coming today.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:4px 10px 4px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:32px;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;width:44px\">5.</td><td style=\"padding:4px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:32px\">Thank you. Goodbye.</td></tr></table>"
    },
    {
      "layout": "content",
      "id": "answer-cutup-b2-1",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#052e0d",
      "title": "Answers: Sentence Cut-Up (B2) &mdash; 1/2",
      "body": "<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td style=\"padding:4px 10px 4px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:32px;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;width:44px\">1.</td><td style=\"padding:4px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:32px\">So, tell me &mdash; how do you usually spend your weekends?</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:4px 10px 4px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:32px;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;width:44px\">2.</td><td style=\"padding:4px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:32px\">That's a good question. Honestly, I try to keep a balance between relaxing and doing something useful.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:4px 10px 4px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:32px;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;width:44px\">3.</td><td style=\"padding:4px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:32px\">The main reason is that I think weekends are for recharging, not just for homework.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:4px 10px 4px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:32px;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;width:44px\">4.</td><td style=\"padding:4px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:32px\">For example, on Saturday mornings I help my family at our market stall, and in the afternoon I swim.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:4px 10px 4px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:32px;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;width:44px\">5.</td><td style=\"padding:4px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:32px\">However, I also spend a couple of hours on Sunday studying, especially English.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:4px 10px 4px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:32px;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;width:44px\">6.</td><td style=\"padding:4px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:32px\">So, for me, a good weekend has both fun and a little work.</td></tr></table>"
    },
    {
      "layout": "content",
      "id": "answer-cutup-b2-2",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#052e0d",
      "title": "Answers: Sentence Cut-Up (B2) &mdash; 2/2",
      "body": "<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td style=\"padding:4px 10px 4px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:32px;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;width:44px\">1.</td><td style=\"padding:4px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:32px\">That sounds well planned. And what's something new you'd like to try?</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:4px 10px 4px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:32px;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;width:44px\">2.</td><td style=\"padding:4px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:32px\">I'd love to learn scuba diving.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:4px 10px 4px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:32px;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;width:44px\">3.</td><td style=\"padding:4px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:32px\">I've watched documentaries about coral reefs, and I find the underwater world fascinating.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:4px 10px 4px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:32px;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;width:44px\">4.</td><td style=\"padding:4px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:32px\">For example, a friend of mine started diving last year, and she says it's the most peaceful feeling in the world.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:4px 10px 4px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:32px;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;width:44px\">5.</td><td style=\"padding:4px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:32px\">Wonderful. Thank you for coming. We'll be in touch soon.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:4px 10px 4px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:32px;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;width:44px\">6.</td><td style=\"padding:4px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:32px\">Thank you very much. It was a pleasure.</td></tr></table>"
    },
    {
      "layout": "content",
      "id": "speeddating-transition",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#c0392b",
      "title": "Speed Dating!"
    },
    {
      "layout": "content",
      "id": "speeddating-card",
      "step": 1,
